      "text": "### 📡 RemoteEvents & RemoteFunctions\n- **VehicleRepairRequest:** Client -> Server (Triggered by [R] key)\n- **VehicleImpactEvent:** Server -> Client (Collision shake VFX)\n- **HarvestCropRequest:** Client -> Server (Totem interaction)\n- **FetchPlayerData:** RemoteFunction (Bi-directional player stash query)",
